       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This appears to be directly related to the issue mentioned in this thread (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "557058:a87220be-211e-4d98-b12f-0e772d9888c2",
           "text": "@David Chandek-Stark (old account)"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ")",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/2MIgi-i6HPU/-H3ZmyilBwAJ"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/2MIgi-i6HPU/-H3ZmyilBwAJ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "===========",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "The main issue I think is that requests to binaries under versions do not include the Link: <uri>; rel=\"describedby\" header.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Here's the header when I GET the binary node URI:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Link: <",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/content/fcr:metadata"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/content/fcr:metadata",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ">; rel=\"describedby\"",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "When I request the binary URI under a version (",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/fcr:versions/87a0a8c317f1e7e3193515-7815-4475-8950-95698c75d2e1/content),"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/fcr:versions/87a0a8c317f1e7e3193515-7815-4475-8950-95698c75d2e1/content),",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " the describedby link is absent, although the correct info under the predicate ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/describedby"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/describedby",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " exists at {version_uri}/fcr:metadata.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I imagine this is what drives the HTML UI to redirect to /fcr:metadata for the non-versioned URI, but not for the versioned URI.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "===========",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
